+  // That protocol-relative URL resolves against the chrome://resources/
+  // SHARED origin (content::kChromeUIResourcesHost), which this checkout
+  // populates from the core ui/webui/resources/BUILD.gn "webui" grd — a
+  // tree-wide shared resource bundle consumed by every WebUI page in the
+  // browser. Registering the woff2 correctly requires adding them to that
+  // shared grd (the same mechanism that serves chrome://resources/roboto/
+  // *.woff2 for ui/webui/resources/css/roboto.css); that edit is out of
+  // this plan's file scope (see 14-07-PLAN.md files_modified) and touching
